    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Estimate scope",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Estimated monthly infrastructure costs in USD, not actual charges.** Values are priced-resource subtotals from Infracost. Unsupported resources, missing usage and account-specific free allowances, credits, taxes or discounts may change the bill. Values expire after 24 hours by default. The exporter rereads the file on every scrape but does not run Infracost itself. Refresh the report after Terraform changes. The history shows successive monthly estimates; do not sum these samples into spending. Missing data is not zero cost."
      }
    }
